[{"id":"addon:summons_of_pain:engineer_s_fang","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-25","title":"工程师的尖牙","titleEn":null,"rarity":"ultra","description":["一颗来自某只蝎子状肉质生物口中的尖牙，后者常伴随地狱修士进行严酷的任务。","·魔鬼锁链会伤害健康逃生者，但不会与其绑定或生成额外锁链。","·魔鬼锁链命中健康逃生者后关闭门扉所需时间增加50%。","·魔鬼锁链命中受伤逃生者时，只会生成1条额外锁链。"],"flavor":"“我们有这样一幅景象要给你看。”--钉子头","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_engineersFang.webp","glyph":5,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Engineer%27s_Fang","pinyin":"gongchengshidejianya","initials":"gcsdjy"},{"id":"addon:summons_of_pain:iridescent_lament_configuration","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-25","title":"荧虹哀痛之盒","titleEn":null,"rarity":"ultra","description":["由迷雾铸造出的玻璃状迷匣。这件复制品与原版不同，并提供了全新力量。","·锁链猎捕未生效时，哀痛之盒24米范围外的逃生者无法看到其气场。"],"flavor":"“你打开了它。我们便来了。”——钉子头","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_iridescentLamentConfiguration.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Iridescent_Lament_Configuration","pinyin":"yinghongaitongzhihe","initials":"yhatzh"},{"id":"addon:summons_of_pain:original_pain","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-25","title":"原初痛苦","titleEn":null,"rarity":"very-rare","description":["第一根插入钉子头脑袋上的钉子。快感与痛苦如甚。","·逃生者挣脱锁链后，显示其气场8秒。"],"flavor":"“请不要哭。这是对美好苦难的浪费。”——钉子头","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_originalPain.webp","glyph":1,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Original_Pain","pinyin":"yuanchutongku","initials":"yctk"},{"id":"addon:summons_of_pain:greasy_black_lens","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-25","title":"油腻黑色镜片","titleEn":null,"rarity":"very-rare","description":["一个肥胖地狱修士的墨镜镜片，他的肉卷耷拉在脸上和脖子上。","·被魔鬼锁链命中的逃生者将向你显示6秒。"],"flavor":"一个肥胖地狱修士的墨镜镜片，他的肉卷套拉在脸上和脖子上。","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_greasyBlackLens.webp","glyph":5,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Greasy_Black_Lens","pinyin":"youniheisejingpian","initials":"ynhsjp"},{"id":"addon:summons_of_pain:impaling_wire","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-25","title":"穿刺钢丝","titleEn":null,"rarity":"very-rare","description":["一根钢丝刺穿了某个地狱修士的脸颊，同时露出了她脖子上的缺口。","·逃生者利用环境挣脱锁链后，会被1条额外锁链作为目标。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_impalingWire.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Impaling_Wire","pinyin":"chuancigangsi","initials":"ccgs"},{"id":"addon:summons_of_pain:chatterer_s_tooth","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-25","title":"颤齿的牙齿","titleEn":null,"rarity":"very-rare","description":["来自一个嘴里喋喋不休的拙劣修士的碎片。这颗从他口中掉落的牙齿总算安静下来了。","·显示哀痛之盒。","·拾取哀痛之盒后，锁链猎捕失效。","·拾取哀痛之盒后获得无法侦测状态，持续25秒。","无法侦测状态会隐藏杀手的气场、恐惧范围与红光。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_chatterersTooth.webp","glyph":0,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Chatterer%27s_Tooth","pinyin":"chanchideyachi","initials":"ccdyc"},{"id":"addon:summons_of_pain:slice_of_frank","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-25","title":"弗兰克的切片","titleEn":null,"rarity":"rare","description":["弗兰克在被地狱修士折磨后的一张脸。","·携带哀悼之盒的逃生者会受到疲劳状态影响。","疲劳状态会使逃生者无法激活疲劳相关技能。"],"flavor":"“地狱修士给了我一种超越极限的体验。痛苦和快感，不可分割。”——弗兰克·科顿","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_sliceOfFrank.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Slice_of_Frank","pinyin":"fulankedeqiepian","initials":"flkdqp"},{"id":"addon:summons_of_pain:frank_s_heart","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-25","title":"弗兰克的心脏","titleEn":null,"rarity":"rare","description":["弗兰克搏动的心脏，由他兄弟的鲜血重获新生。","·门扉最大施放距离增加8米。"],"flavor":"“无人能逃出我们的掌心。”——钉子头","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_franksHeart.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Frank%27s_Heart","pinyin":"fulankedexinzang","initials":"flkdxz"},{"id":"addon:summons_of_pain:torture_pillar","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-25","title":"折磨之柱","titleEn":null,"rarity":"rare","description":["这块悬空的石板上覆盖着过去受害者的血迹。","· 锁链猎捕激活所需时间减少6秒。"],"flavor":"“这不是你的眼睛该看的东西。”--钉子头","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_torturePillar.webp","glyph":1,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Torture_Pillar","pinyin":"zhemozhizhu","initials":"zmzz"},{"id":"addon:summons_of_pain:larry_s_remains","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-25","title":"拉里的骸骨","titleEn":null,"rarity":"rare","description":["拉里·科顿的骸骨，覆盖着一层厚重黏稠的鲜血。","· 逃生者解开哀痛之盒后需时间增加2秒。"],"flavor":"“把这件事的始作俑者交给我们。”——钉子头","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_larrysRemains.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Larry%27s_Remains","pinyin":"lalidehaigu","initials":"lldhg"},{"id":"addon:summons_of_pain:larry_s_blood","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-25","title":"拉里的鲜血","titleEn":null,"rarity":"rare","description":["拉里·科顿的鲜血，使他的兄弟弗兰克部分复活。","·魔鬼锁链最大移动距离增加4米。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_larrysBlood.webp","glyph":0,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Larry%27s_Blood","pinyin":"lalidexianxue","initials":"lldxx"},{"id":"addon:summons_of_pain:skewered_rat","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-25","title":"串烧老鼠","titleEn":null,"rarity":"uncommon","description":["科顿家的老鼠问题的粗略解决方案。","·发动魔鬼锁链后的痛苦召唤冷却时间减少9%。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_skeweredRat.webp","glyph":7,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Skewered_Rat","pinyin":"chuanshaolaoshu","initials":"csls"},{"id":"addon:summons_of_pain:liquified_gore","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-25","title":"液化血块","titleEn":null,"rarity":"uncommon","description":["召唤地狱修士的结果。没人知道这是人体的哪个部位。","·逃生者解开哀痛之盒所需时间增加1秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_liquifiedGore.webp","glyph":5,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Liquified_Gore","pinyin":"yehuaxuekuai","initials":"yhxk"},{"id":"addon:summons_of_pain:wriggling_maggots","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-25","title":"蠕动蛆虫","titleEn":null,"rarity":"uncommon","description":["从藏在科顿家的一具尸体口中涌出的幼虫。","·魔鬼锁链转向速度增加15%。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_wrigglingMaggots.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Wriggling_Maggots","pinyin":"rudongquchong","initials":"rdqc"},{"id":"addon:summons_of_pain:flickering_television","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-25","title":"闪烁电视","titleEn":null,"rarity":"uncommon","description":["地狱修士到来时表现怪异的电视。","·门扉最大施放距离增加4米。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_flickeringTelevision.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Flickering_Television","pinyin":"shanshuodianshi","initials":"ssds"},{"id":"addon:summons_of_pain:spoiled_meal","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-25","title":"霉变饭菜","titleEn":null,"rarity":"uncommon","description":["一堆霉菌，成了一只蟑螂的大餐。可能是弗兰克·科顿神秘消失的征兆……","·魔鬼锁链最大移动距离增加2米。"],"flavor":"一堆霉菌，成了一只蟑螂的大餐。可能是弗兰克·科顿神秘消失的征兆。","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_spoiledMeal.webp","glyph":7,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Spoiled_Meal","pinyin":"meibianfancai","initials":"mbfc"},{"id":"addon:summons_of_pain:bent_nail","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-25","title":"弯曲钉子","titleEn":null,"rarity":"common","description":["一枚简单的钉子，深深扎进拉里·科顿的手里。虽然损害是表面的，但它引发了一连串可怕的事件。","·魔鬼锁链绑定逃生者时，获得100%额外血点。","·魔鬼锁链命中逃生者时，只会生成1条额外锁链。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_bentNail.webp","glyph":7,"confidence":0.98,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Bent_Nail","pinyin":"wanqudingzi","initials":"wqdz"},{"id":"addon:summons_of_pain:burning_candle","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-25","title":"燃烧蜡烛","titleEn":null,"rarity":"common","description":["弗兰克·科顿在一次致命的召唤仪式上点燃的蜡烛。","·锁链猎捕激活所需时间减少3秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_burningCandle.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Burning_Candle","pinyin":"ranshaolazhu","initials":"rslz"},{"id":"addon:summons_of_pain:leather_strip","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-25","title":"皮带","titleEn":null,"rarity":"common","description":["从地狱修士的制服上撕下的皮带，能用来残害暴露的肉体。","·发动魔鬼锁链后的痛苦召唤冷却时间减少3%。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_leatherStrip.webp","glyph":1,"confidence":0.97,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Leather_Strip","pinyin":"pidai","initials":"pd"},{"id":"addon:summons_of_pain:lively_crickets","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-25","title":"鲜活蟋蟀","titleEn":null,"rarity":"common","description":["无法避免被某位神秘漂泊者吃掉的昆虫。","·魔鬼锁链转向速度增加10%"],"flavor":"无法避免被某位神秘漂泊者吃掉的昆虫。","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_livelyCrickets.webp","glyph":5,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Lively_Crickets","pinyin":"xianhuoxishuai","initials":"xhxs"}]
